& [BuildPlanningAndApproval]
  + a NativeBuildExecutionPlan is separate from the read-only Slice5 candidate plan and binds the whole candidate projection exact argument vector pinned runner environment disposable root finite budgets one output and fixed non-authority
  + requested resource scope is derived from the named disposable root and capability evidence partitions exact requested capabilities and resource scopes
  + supplied sandbox admission records physical-profile evidence without inferring containment from path grammar
  + one normalized approval statement is signed by distinct seed-bound Security and external-authority Ed25519 keys
  + trust-store revocation validity and role separation are replayed before a certificate is recognized

& [ObservationAndReceipt]
  + supplied observations bind authorization candidate plan runner sandbox command environment logical interval exit streams resources artifacts faults and disposition
  + failed timed-out cancelled and infrastructure-fault observations remain evidence and never project artifact receipts
  + one successful bounded observation with exact artifact identity path digest byte size media type target and build input may project only ProducedUnverified
  + a signed approval identity rather than a replaceable certificate envelope is the local single-use ledger key
  + global atomic compare-and-swap remains an external host-adapter obligation and is not claimed by a forkable pure value

& [IndependentVerification]
  + a verifier plan pins a verifier identity program configuration artifact interface toolchain evidence and predeclared checks
  + verifier identity and program differ from runner and approval signers
  + supplied facts derive exact Passed Failed or Unresolved check maps and cannot directly select their disposition
  + optional reproducibility requires a whole-replay-valid second receipt with distinct signed approval certificate attempt and receipt plus equal artifact identity digest bytes target build input and toolchain configuration
  + every verification form retains a fixed non-authority excluding signing admission installation deployment execution effects and successor recognition

& [EffectBoundary]
  + cantor_core performs deterministic form projection digesting Ed25519 verification and supplied-evidence checking only
  + no production filesystem process clock environment network signing-key sandbox or runner adapter exists

